se, define a 21-day biological clock in cyclin haematopoiesis</article-title><source>Nat Genet</source><year>1999</year><volume>23</volume><fpage>433</fpage><lpage>436</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10581030</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/70544</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Morley</surname><given-names>AA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A neutrophil cycle in healthy individuals</article-title><source>Lancet</source><year>1966</year><volume>3</volume><fpage>1220</fpage><lpage>1222</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">4163702</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0140-6736(66)92303-8</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Saunders</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Sources of physiological variation in differential leukocyte counting</article-title><source>Blood Cells</source><year>1985</year><volume>11</volume><fpage>13</fpage><lpage>48</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>El-Kalla</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Baysal</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>alpha-thalassemia in the United Arab Emirates</article-title><source>Acta Haematol</source><year>1998</year><volume>100</volume><fpage>49</fpage><lpage>53</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9691147</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1159/000040863</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Nathan</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Neutrophils and immunity: challenges and opportunities</article-title><source>Nat Rev Immunol</source><year>2006</year><volume>6</volume><fpage>173</fpag